Package: dCCA
Title: Differential Canonical Correlation Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      "Yuzi", "Li", 
      email = "yli493@jh.edu", 
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Estimates shared canonical weights maximizing weighted
    Fisher-transformed or raw correlations across paired sample groups,
    with sparse constraints and covariance deflation.
